{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_1","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"天祚皇帝，諱延禧，字延寧，小字阿果。道宗之孫，父順宗大孝順聖皇帝，母貞順皇后蕭氏。大康元年生。六歲封梁王，加守太尉，兼中書令。後三年，進封燕國王。大安七年，總北南院樞密使事，加尚書令，為天下兵馬大元帥。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_2","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"壽隆七年正月甲戌，道宗崩，奉遺詔即皇帝位于柩前。群臣上尊號曰天祚皇帝。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_3","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"二月壬辰朔，改元乾統，大赦。詔為耶律乙辛所誣陷者，復其官爵，籍沒者出之，流放者還之。乙未，遣使告哀于宋及西夏、高麗。乙巳，以北府宰相蕭兀納為遼興軍節度使，加守太傅。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_4","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"三月丁卯，詔有司以張孝傑家屬分賜群臣。甲戌，召僧法頤放戒于內庭。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_5","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"夏四月，旱。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_6","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"六月庚寅朔，如慶州。甲午，宋遣王潛等來弔祭。丙申，高麗、夏國各遣使慰奠。戊戌，以南府宰相斡特剌兼南院樞密使。庚子，追諡懿德皇后為宣懿皇后。壬寅，以宋魏國王和魯斡為天下兵馬大元帥。乙巳，以北平郡王淳進封鄭王。丁未，北院樞密使耶律阿思加于越。辛亥，葬仁聖大孝文皇帝、宣懿皇后于慶陵。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_7","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"秋七月癸亥，阻卜、鐵驪來貢。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_8","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"八月甲寅，謁慶陵。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_9","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"九月壬申，謁懷陵。乙亥，駐蹕藕絲淀。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_10","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"冬十月壬辰，謁乾陵。甲辰，上皇考昭懷太子諡曰大孝順聖皇帝，廟號順宗，皇妣曰貞順皇后。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_11","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"十二月戊子，以樞密副使張琳知樞密院事，翰林學士張奉珪參知政事兼同知樞密院事。癸巳，宋遣黃實來賀即位。丁酉，高麗、夏國並遣使來賀。乙巳，詔先朝已行事，不得陳告。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_12","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"初，以楊割為生女直部節度使，其俗呼為太師。是歲楊割死，傳于兄之子烏雅束，束死，其弟阿骨打襲。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_13","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"二年春正月，如鴨子河。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_14","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"二月辛卯，如春州。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_15","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"三月，大寒，冰復合。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_16","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"夏四月辛亥，詔誅乙辛黨，徙其子孫于邊；發乙辛、得里特之墓，剖棺，戮屍；以其家屬分賜被殺之家。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_17","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"五月乙丑，斡特剌獻耶睹刮等部捷。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_18","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"六月壬辰，以雨罷獵，駐蹕散水原。丙午，夏國王李乾順復遣使請尚公主。丁未，南院大王陳家奴致仕。壬子，李乾順為宋所攻，遣李造福、田若水求援。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_19","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"閏月庚申，策賢良。壬申，降惠妃為庶人。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_20","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"秋七月，獵黑嶺，以霖雨，給獵人馬。阻卜來侵，斡特剌等戰敗之。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_21","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"冬十月乙卯，蕭海里叛，劫乾州武庫器甲。命北面林牙郝家奴捕之，蕭海里亡入陪朮水阿典部。丙寅，以南府宰相耶律斡特剌為北院樞密使，參知政事牛溫舒知南院樞密使事。","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_22","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"十一月乙未，郝家奴以不獲蕭海里，免官。壬寅，以上京留守耶律慎思為北院樞密副使。有司請以帝生日為天興節。","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_23","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"三年春正月辛巳朔，如混同江。女直函蕭海里首，遣使來獻。戊申，如春州。","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_24","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"二月庚午，以武清縣大水，弛其陂澤之禁。","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_25","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"夏五月戊子，以獵人多亡，嚴立科禁。乙巳，清暑赤勒嶺。丙午，謁慶陵。","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_26","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"六月辛酉，夏國王李乾順復遣使請尚公主。","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_27","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"秋七月，中京雨雹，傷稼。","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_28","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"冬十月甲辰，如中京。己未，吐蕃遣使來貢。庚申，夏國復遣使求援。己巳，有事于觀德殿。","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_29","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"十一月丙申，文武百官加上尊號曰惠文智武聖孝天祚皇帝，大赦，以宋魏國王和魯斡為皇太叔，梁王撻魯進封燕國王，鄭王淳為東京留守，進封越國王，百官各進一階。丁酉，以惕隱耶律何魯掃古為南院大王。戊戌，以受尊號，告廟。乙巳，謁太祖廟，追尊太祖之高祖曰昭烈皇帝，廟號肅祖，妣曰昭烈皇后；曾祖曰莊敬皇帝，廟號懿祖，妣曰莊敬皇后。召監修國史耶律儼纂太祖諸帝實錄。","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_30","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"十二月戊申，如藕絲淀。","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_31","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"是年，放進士馬恭回等百三人。","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_32","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"四年春正月戊子，幸魚兒濼。壬寅，獵木嶺。癸卯，燕國王撻魯薨。","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_33","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"二月丁丑，鼻骨德遣使來貢。","sentenceOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_34","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"夏六月甲辰，駐蹕旺國崖。甲寅，夏國遣李造福、田若水求援。癸亥，吐蕃遣使來貢。","sentenceOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_35","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"秋七月，南京蝗。庚辰，獵南山。癸未，以西北路招討使蕭得里底、北院樞密副使耶律慎思並知北院樞密使事。辛卯，以同知南院樞密使事蕭敵里為西北路招討使。","sentenceOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_36","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"冬十月己酉，鳳凰見于漷陰。己未，幸南京。","sentenceOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_37","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"十一月乙亥，御迎月樓，賜貧民錢。","sentenceOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_38","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"十二月辛丑，以張琳為南府宰相。","sentenceOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_39","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"五年春正月乙亥，夏國遣李造福等來求援，且乞伐宋。庚寅，以遼興軍節度使蕭常哥為北府宰相。丁酉，遣樞密直學士高端禮等諷宋罷伐夏兵。","sentenceOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_40","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"二月癸卯，微行，視民疾苦。丙午，幸鴛鴦濼。","sentenceOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_41","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"三月壬申，以族女南仙封成安公主，下嫁夏國王李乾順。","sentenceOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_42","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"夏四月甲申，射虎炭山。","sentenceOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_43","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"五月癸卯，清暑南崖。壬子，宋遣曾孝廣、王戩報聘。","sentenceOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_44","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"六月甲戌，夏國遣使來謝，及貢方物。己丑，幸候里吉。","sentenceOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_45","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"秋七月，謁慶陵。","sentenceOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_46","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"九月辛亥，駐蹕藕絲淀。乙卯，謁乾陵。","sentenceOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_47","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"冬十一月戊戌，禁商賈之家應進士舉。丙辰，高麗三韓國公王顒薨，子俁遣使來告。","sentenceOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_48","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"十二月己巳，夏國復遣李造福、田若水求援。癸酉，宋遣林洙來議與夏約和。","sentenceOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_49","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"六年春正月辛丑，遣知北院樞密使事蕭得里底、知南院樞密使事牛溫舒使宋，諷歸所侵夏地。","sentenceOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_50","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"夏五月，清暑散水原。","sentenceOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_51","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"六月辛巳，夏國遣李造福等來謝。","sentenceOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_52","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"秋七月癸巳，阻卜來貢。甲午，如黑嶺。庚子，獵鹿角山。","sentenceOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_53","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"冬十月乙亥，宋與夏通好，遣劉正符、曹穆來告。庚辰，以皇太叔、南京留守和魯斡兼惕隱，東京留守、越國王淳為南府宰相。","sentenceOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_54","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"十一月乙未，以謝家奴為南院大王，馬奴為奚六部大王。丙申，行柴冊禮。戊戌，大赦。以和魯斡為義和仁聖皇太叔，越國王淳進封魏國王，封皇子敖盧斡為晉王，習泥烈為饒樂郡王。己亥，謁太祖廟。甲辰，祠木葉山。","sentenceOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_55","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"十二月己巳，封耶律儼為漆水郡王，餘官進爵有差。","sentenceOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_56","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"七年春正月，鉤魚于鴨子河。","sentenceOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_57","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"二月，駐蹕大魚濼。","sentenceOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_58","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"夏六月，次散水原。","sentenceOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_59","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"秋七月，如黑嶺。","sentenceOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_60","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"冬十月，謁乾陵，獵醫巫閭山。","sentenceOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_61","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"是年，放進士李石等百人。","sentenceOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_62","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"八年春正月，如春州。","sentenceOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_63","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"夏四月丙申，封高麗王俁為三韓國公，贈其父顒為高麗國王。","sentenceOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_64","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"五月，清暑散水原。","sentenceOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_65","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"六月壬辰，西北路招討使蕭敵里率諸蕃來朝。丙申，射柳祈雨。壬寅，夏國王李乾順以成安公主生子，遣使來告。丁未，如黑嶺。","sentenceOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_66","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"秋七月戊辰，以雨罷獵。","sentenceOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_67","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"冬十二月己卯，高麗遣使來謝。","sentenceOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_68","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"九年春正月丙午朔，如鴨子河。","sentenceOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_69","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"二月，如春州。","sentenceOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_70","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"三月戊午，夏國以宋不歸地，遣使來告。","sentenceOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_71","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"夏四月壬午，五國部來貢。","sentenceOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_72","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"六月乙亥，清暑特禮嶺。","sentenceOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_73","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"秋七月，隕霜，傷稼。甲寅，獵于候里吉。","sentenceOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_74","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"八月丁酉，雪，罷獵。","sentenceOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_75","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"冬十月癸酉，望祠木葉山。丁丑，詔免今年租稅。","sentenceOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_76","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"十二月甲申，高麗遣使來貢。","sentenceOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_77","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"是年，放進士劉楨等九十人。","sentenceOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_78","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"十年春正月辛丑，預行立春禮。如鴨子河。","sentenceOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_79","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"二月庚午朔，駐蹕大魚濼。","sentenceOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_80","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"夏四月丙子，五國部長來貢。丙戌，預行再生禮。癸巳，獵于北山。","sentenceOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_81","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"六月甲戌，清暑玉丘。癸未，夏國遣李造福等來貢。甲午，阻卜來貢。","sentenceOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_82","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"秋七月辛丑，謁慶陵。","sentenceOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_83","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"閏月辛亥，謁懷陵。己未，謁祖陵。壬戌，皇太叔和魯斡薨。","sentenceOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_84","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"九月甲戌，免重九節禮。","sentenceOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_85","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"冬十月，駐蹕藕絲淀。","sentenceOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_86","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"十二月己酉，改明年元。","sentenceOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_87","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"是歲，大饑。","sentenceOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_88","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"天慶元年春正月，鉤魚于鴨子河。","sentenceOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_89","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"二月，如春州。","sentenceOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_90","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"三月乙亥，五國部長來貢。","sentenceOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_91","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"夏五月，清暑散水原。","sentenceOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_92","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"秋七月，獵。","sentenceOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_93","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"冬十月，駐蹕藕絲淀。","sentenceOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_94","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"二年春正月己未朔，如鴨子河。丁丑，五國部長來貢。","sentenceOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_95","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"二月丁酉，如春州，幸混同江鉤魚，界外生女直酋長在千里內者，以故事皆來朝。適遇「頭魚宴」，酒半酣，上臨軒，命諸酋次第起舞；獨阿骨打辭以不能。諭之再三，終不從。他日，上密謂樞密使蕭奉先曰：「前日之燕，阿骨打意氣雄豪，顧視不常，可託以邊事誅之。否則，必貽後患。」奉先曰：「麁人不知禮義，無大過而殺之，恐傷向化之心。假有異志，又何能為？」其弟吳乞買、粘罕、胡舍等嘗從獵，能呼鹿，刺虎，搏熊。上喜，輒加官爵。","sentenceOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_96","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"夏六月庚寅，清暑南崖。甲午，和州回鶻來貢。戊戌，成安公主來朝。甲辰，阻卜來貢。","sentenceOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_97","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"秋七月乙丑，獵南山。","sentenceOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_98","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"九月己未，射獲熊，燕群臣，上親御琵琶。初，阿骨打混同江宴歸，疑上知其異志，遂稱兵，先併旁近部族。女直趙三、阿鶻產拒之，阿骨打虜其家屬。二人走訴咸州，詳穩司送北樞密院。樞密使蕭奉先作常事以聞上，仍送咸州詰責，欲使自新。後數召，阿骨打竟稱疾不至。","sentenceOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_99","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"冬十月辛亥，高麗三韓國公王俁之母死，來告，即遣使致祭，起復。是月，駐蹕奉聖州。","sentenceOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_100","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"十一月乙卯，幸南京。丁卯，謁太祖廟。","sentenceOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_101","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"是年，放進士韓昉等七十七人。","sentenceOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_102","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"三年春正月丙寅，賜南京貧民錢。丁卯，如大魚濼。甲戌，禁僧尼破戒。丙子，獵狗牙山，大寒，獵人多死。","sentenceOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_103","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"三月，籍諸道戶，徙大牢古山圍場地居民于別土。阿骨打一日率五百騎突至咸州，吏民大驚。翌日，赴詳穩司，與趙三等面折庭下。阿骨打不屈，送所司問狀。一夕遁去。遣人訴于上，謂詳穩司欲見殺，故不敢留。自是召不復至。","sentenceOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_104","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"夏閏四月，李弘以左道聚眾為亂，支解，分示五京。","sentenceOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_105","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"六月乙卯，斡朗改國遣使來貢良犬。丙辰，夏國遣使來貢。","sentenceOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_106","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"秋七月，幸秋山。","sentenceOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_107","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"九月，駐蹕藕絲淀。","sentenceOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_108","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"十一月甲午，以三司使虞融知南院樞密使事，西南面招討使蕭樂古為南府宰相。","sentenceOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_109","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"十二月庚戌，高麗遣使來謝致祭。癸丑，回鶻遣使來貢。甲寅，以樞密直學士馬人望參知政事。丙辰，知樞密院事耶律儼薨。癸亥，高麗遣使來謝起復。","sentenceOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_110","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"四年春正月，如春州。初，女直起兵，以紇石烈部人阿疏不從，遣其部撒改討之。阿疏弟狄故保來告，詔諭使勿討，不聽，阿疏來奔。至是女直遣使來索，不發。","sentenceOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_111","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"夏五月，清暑散水原。","sentenceOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_112","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"秋七月，女直復遣使取阿疏，不發，乃遣侍御阿息保問境上多建城堡之故。女直以慢語答曰：「若還阿疏，朝貢如故；不然，城未能已。」遂發渾河北諸軍，益東北路統軍司。阿骨打乃與弟粘罕、胡舍等謀，以銀朮割、移烈、婁室、闍母等為帥，集女直諸部兵，擒遼障鷹官。及攻寧江州，東北路統軍司以聞。時上在慶州射鹿，聞之略不介意，遣海州刺史高仙壽統渤海軍應援。蕭撻不也遇女直，戰于寧江東，敗績。","sentenceOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_113","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"冬十月壬寅朔，以守司空蕭嗣先為東北路都統，靜江軍節度使蕭撻不也為副，發契丹奚軍三千人，中京禁兵及土豪二千人，別選諸路武勇二千餘人，以虞候崔公義為都押官，控鶴指揮邢穎為副，引軍屯出河店。兩軍對壘，女直軍潛渡混同江，掩擊遼眾。蕭嗣先軍潰，崔公義、邢穎、耶律佛留、蕭葛十等死之，其獲免者十有七人。蕭奉先懼其弟嗣先獲罪，輒奏東征潰軍所至劫掠，若不肆赦，恐聚為患。上從之，嗣先但免官而已。諸軍相謂曰：「戰則有死而無功，退則有生而無罪。」故士無鬥志，望風奔潰。","sentenceOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_114","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"十一月壬辰，都統蕭敵里等營于斡鄰濼東，又為女直所襲，士卒死者甚眾。甲午，蕭敵里亦坐免官。辛丑，以西北路招討使耶律斡里朵為行軍都統，副點檢蕭乙薛、同知南院樞密使事耶律章奴副之。","sentenceOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_27_115","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_27","textTraditional":"十二月，咸、賓、祥三州及鐵驪、兀惹皆叛入女直。乙薛往援賓州，南軍諸將實婁、特烈等往援咸州，並為女直所敗。","sentenceOrder":115}],"overrides":{}}